{
  "id": "1SA.28",
  "number": "28",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Samweli 28",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba askwearjoojigiga ghabwat geat fuga Filisti aba ng'ucheeda, nea gagasa gang'uchi sea Israeli. Ghwalamda Akishi ak gwayeesha Dawdi, “Nala gideaba ang'iing'i ea fugaagu gajeeteayeena lugooda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Dawdi Akishi, “Ghwahit muuchi, gaynala gichea gwasin siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda.” Gwayeesha Akishi Dawdi, “Ghwahit muuchi, gaydanung' huwa siida jea gafuran galeaga sean.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sawli goobalool giijoodiga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu ghami Samweli, ak gooyeawda buuneesean aba badaydaanyi ak geebung'sa Rama was mujiineadaanyi. Ak ghahoan Sawli giijoodiga ea beeneediga aba jeeda ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghabwat geat fuga Filisti, ak ghapka ak gooduuw aba Shunemu; ak ghabwada geat Sawli buuneesean bea Israeli, ak gooduuw aba Gilbowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwadaah Sawli lugooda Filisti, hean ghabeal, ak ghabeal gurooroadaanyi muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iidu nea ghamwaash NG'UTAMIIDA, ea mwasha NG'UTAMIIDA ghuutaanyi, eara aba giirgweatka, ghana aba ashoohoocheanda ghana aba sibanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwalamda Sawli ak gwayeesha fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda, “Agakuuneani gatmooda was giijoocheanda, daweesa ak ghaanyaashchi.” Ghwalamda fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda ak gwayeesha, “Ng'ula, gwanda giijoocheanda ng'eanyiida Endori.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwayam Sawli hang'weaka ak gookwa hang'weaka suuk, ak gawa nea goodeayi fih iyeenya; ak ghapka heeda gatmooda eawa. Ak gwayeesha, “Ascheeng'nean meanga ak gaydarukuneey dea eagasayi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda gatmooda ak gwayeesha, “Aba huumwa ginali gidanisin Sawli, gidahoanda giijoodiga ea beeneediga aba jeeda ng'eanyiida. Abeeda ghwasaan inyas gisini ghaseeda eaweegeasu ak gigasayi eani miyeedeanyu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gweaksa Sawli niny habeawooda aba badayda NG'UTAMIIDA, “Aba gidabiideata NG'UTAMIIDA, manda bileangida jea ghwahineey aba badaydeaba ng'asheanji.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha gatmooda, “Gigasayi deascheeng'neey ng'eaha?” Gwayeesha, “Ascheeng'nean Samweli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwadaah gatmooda Samweli, gooyeawda nea goojuur; ak gwayeesha gatmooda Sawli, “Ghwasaan inyas gireenganean? Ang'iing'i guwoosi Sawli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda sugoocheanda ak gwayeesha niny, “Adibeali; gidaahi naaha?” Gwayeesha gatmooda Sawli, “Ghaadaayi aseeta nea gwascheeng'u ghwaan badayda ng'eanyiida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha niny gatmooda, “Niny geeratiidaan?” Ak gwayeesha, “Gwascheeng'u siida waas; nea siikwealsa hang'da geaw.” Ak ghwanal Sawli gideaba Samweli gil, ak gwatkuy ea ghang'uda gheamamdaanyi ng'eanyi, ak ghaghadoawan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwalamda Samweli ak gwayeesha Sawli, “Ghwasaan inyas giineayanean aba giischeeng'nooda?” Ghwasha Sawli nea gwayeesha, “Aniini geandi jeeda sawanadeeda haw; aba gideaba fuga Filisti geang'ucheewi, ninung'usean heeda ASEETA ak ea mudu gwasheaha ng'asheegeasu, aba sibanga ghana aba giirgweatka; ak geaguurneey rukunean gida jea dasin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwasha Samweli nea gwayeesha, “Abeeda ghwasaan inyas giinyaashchaan, nea ninung'useey heeda NG'UTAMIIDA ak ghoah weajoocheandaang'u? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'iing'i gwasineey NG'UTAMIIDA gidaghayi earukuneey; aba gideaba nigeandeawa NG'UTAMIIDA sugoocheanduumeeda geatingaagu, ak ghoadaw giischeewoocheandaang'u was Dawdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba mudu awala ng'asheega NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ea mii easiina nyarasta ng'waan fuga Amaleki, ak gwasineey NG'UTAMIIDA ng'asheanji askweareani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghwayiinyi ang'iing'i ea fuga Israeli geatinga fuga Filisti; ak numuji ang'iing'i ea orjoagaagu gajeendeayeena sea aniini; gayghwayiin NG'UTAMIIDA eara lugooda Israeli geatinga fuga Filisti.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deagheata ghoabeada Sawli aba geeshangiga, ak ghabeal muuchi aba ng'asheega Samweli; ea goosheala uurda, aba gideaba mii ghwaak gil askwearda sean ea eaweesean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwahidu gatmooda heeda Sawli, amadu nea ghwadaah gideaba nibeal, gwayeesha, “Ng'ula, hudaang'u gooleeyseey iit; naanung' gwashageada eaweegeasu ak ea naayiinyi ng'asheega irukunean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa aleeysiina iit hudaang'u bea gadiyeeda; nung' dasineey mukaate; ak giyaagi, ak abeeda ginyasi uurda aba damanda jea beawana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghaheawa, ak gwayeesha, “Mwaydaak.” Nea fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda, sea gatmooda, gwayeesha niny agiischeena; ak ghwayiiy ng'asheega nyaawa. Hean ghang'eat aba ng'eanyi, ak goopteada aba badayda bulaliida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gwandeawa gatmooda meayda riishaat aba ghoah, ak ghwalamwach gwanuus, ak gageanu dearanga, ak gwasin ak ghoawu mukaateeyda meamwatawiida, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghwayiin madeeda Sawli ea fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda; ak gweagiischi. Ng'ata ghang'eat ng'eat eaweedida ak gaweay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
